From: MrBoogus <90836807+MrBoogus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:18:32 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] core: bump to v2.0, modernize main menu navigation, and
 enhance status dashboard

- Bump application version to 2.0 and update manifest metadata in application.fam.
- Expand application state in fmps_cxt.h and fmps_cxt.c to allocate and manage
  all 10 modular tool views.
- Refactor main_page.c to organize operations into categorized items with icon
  indicators and direct submenu navigation.
- Update operate_page to handle scrollable item lists and back navigation.
- Enhance status_page with 4 telemetry pages (Core, Power, Link, Sched)
  displaying battery fuel gauge, CEP SPI activity, and live round-trip latency.
